.PP
Running agents under service accounts on one host \(em what an account does
on its own, what every operator shares, and what stays private to each:
.I /usr/share/doc/ai\-tools/docs/operators/service\-accounts.md
.PP
How an entrypoint is verified against its vendor's signed release, what the pin
holds, and what a launch does with each outcome:
.I /usr/share/doc/ai\-tools/docs/system/entrypoint\-verification.md
